  "goodToKnow": "Die Eingabe is input or entry in computing (die Eingabe von Daten, die Eingabetaste, the Enter key) and a formal petition or complaint to an authority. In the GDR, writing an Eingabe to officials was one of the few ways citizens could complain, and hundreds of thousands were written every year. The verb eingeben means to enter data: das Passwort eingeben. Plural: die Eingaben."
